From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Hermes Local Integration <hermes-local-ci@localhost>
Date: Mon, 10 Aug 2026 21:10:00 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] feat(projects): add Project Centre lifecycle RPCs

Wire persistent pinning, repository clone, archive/remove management and
explicit file-deletion RPCs into the stable Project registry.

